          "Hint 2: Allocate a dataset via JCL with an explicit DATACLAS keyword — e.g., //OUT DD DSN=&SYSUID..SMS.OVERRIDE,DISP=(NEW,CATLG,DELETE),DATACLAS=DC_FB80,SPACE=(TRK,(2,1)).",
