          "Hint 3: Type S next to xxxxMSTR + Enter to see DDs. STEPLIB will reference the MQ load library (typically SCSQAUTH); CSQINP1 / CSQINP2 / CSQINPX DDs hold the MQSC initialisation commands processed at QMgr startup.",
          "Hint 4: S on JESMSGLG and FIND 'CSQY' — CSQYxxxx messages report queue manager startup events. CSQY000I 'IBM MQ for z/OS - 9.x.x' confirms the release. CSQY022I is the 'STARTED' marker; CSQY023I is the 'STOPPED' message.",
